| A | 2 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
| A | 3 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
| A | 4 | M | M | N | M | M | M | M | M | Non-lens inference filed under `DISCARDED METAPHOR`. |
| A | 5 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
| A | 6 | M | M | N | M | M | M | M | M | Non-lens accepted-to-presented overclaim filed under `DISCARDED METAPHOR`. |
| B | 1 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
| B | 2 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
| B | 3 | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | M | None. |
